    "description": "Buổi 25 theo syllabus FLM · 5 slide.",
    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">EVN301 · Chapter 5 · Session 25</span>\n<h2>Session 25 — Field trip or guest speaker</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 14404 · session plan</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">EVN301 · Chương 5 · Buổi 25</span>\n<h2>Buổi 25 — Field trip or guest speaker</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 14404 · kế hoạch buổi</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO4, CLO5</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">U</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slides in this lesson</span><span class=\"v\">5</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Hình thức</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO4, CLO5</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">U</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slide trong bài</span><span class=\"v\">5</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>What this session covers (FLM, verbatim)</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nội dung buổi học (FLM, nguyên văn)</h3></div>\n<p>Field trip or guest speaker</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Student's tasks</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên</h3></div>\n<p>Discussion, Exercises.</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>📑 School slides — Week 5- 5.1 (5 slides)</h3>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\">matched by content (deck title ↔ session topic). File: Week 5- 5.1.pptx</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>📑 Slide của trường — Week 5- 5.1 (5 slide)</h3>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\">ghép theo nội dung (tên deck ↔ chủ đề buổi). Tệp: Week 5- 5.1.pptx</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/EVN301/flm1/d09/001.webp\" alt=\"EVN301 · Week 5- 5.1 · slide 1: FIELD TRIP OR GUEST SPEAKER\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">Week 5- 5.1 · slide 1/5</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>FIELD TRIP OR GUEST SPEAKER</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/EVN301/flm1/d09/002.webp\" alt=\"EVN301 · Week 5- 5.1 · slide 2: Before the Seminar:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">Week 5- 5.1 · slide 2/5</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Before the Seminar:<br>Research the speaker: Learn about their background, expertise, and the topic they will be discussing.<br>Prepare questions: Think about what interests you and what you'd like to learn more about.<br>Review relevant course material: This will help you understand the context of the speaker's presentation.<br>During the Seminar:<br>Be attentive: Pay close attention to the speaker's words and visuals.<br>Take notes: Jot down key points and ideas that resonate with you.<br>Ask questions: When appropriate, raise your hand and ask thoughtful questions.<br>Participate actively: If there are opportunities for group discussions or activities, engage fully.<br>After the Seminar:<br>Reflect on the presentation: Consider the main points and how they relate to your studies or interests.<br>Follow up: If you have further questions or want to learn more, reach out to the speaker or do additional research.<br>Remember: Guest speakers offer valuable insights and experiences. By actively participating and engaging with the speaker, you can gain a deeper understanding of the topic and potentially network with professionals in your field.<br>GUEST SPEAKER SEMINAR</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/EVN301/flm1/d09/003.webp\" alt=\"EVN301 · Week 5- 5.1 · slide 3: Before the Trip:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">Week 5- 5.1 · slide 3/5</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Before the Trip:<br>Do your research: Learn about the destination and what you can expect to see or do.<br>Prepare questions: Think about what interests you and what you'd like to learn more about.<br>Pack appropriately: Bring necessary items like comfortable shoes, a hat, sunscreen, and any required equipment.<br>During the Trip:<br>Be respectful: Follow the rules and guidelines set by your teachers or guides.<br>Stay together: Avoid wandering off on your own.<br>Be observant: Pay attention to your surroundings and take in the sights and sounds.<br>Ask questions: Don't hesitate to ask your teachers or guides for more information.<br>Participate: Engage in activities and discussions.<br>After the Trip:<br>Reflect: Think about what you learned and what you enjoyed most.<br>Share your experiences: Tell your friends and family about your field trip.<br>Apply your knowledge: Consider how the field trip relates to your studies or interests.<br>FIELD TRIP</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/EVN301/flm1/d09/004.webp\" alt=\"EVN301 · Week 5- 5.1 · slide 4: Reference\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">Week 5- 5.1 · slide 4/5</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Reference<br>Ruth Dowson, Bernadette Albert, Dan Lomax - Event Planning and Management_ Principles, Planning and Practice-Kogan Page (2022)<br>(Event management series) William O'Toole - Events feasibility and development _ from strategy to operations (2022)</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/EVN301/flm1/d09/005.webp\" alt=\"EVN301 · Week 5- 5.1 · slide 5: THANK YOU!\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">Week 5- 5.1 · slide 5/5</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>THANK YOU!</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
