    "description": "Buổi 56 theo syllabus FLM.",
    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">EVN301 · Chapter 6 · Session 56 · assessment / review</span>\n<h2>Session 56 — Activity - Event's Results Presentation</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 14404 · session plan</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">EVN301 · Chương 6 · Buổi 56 · kiểm tra / ôn tập</span>\n<h2>Buổi 56 — Activity - Event's Results Presentation</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 14404 · kế hoạch buổi</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO4, CLO5</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">U</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slides in this lesson</span><span class=\"v\">none from FLM</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Hình thức</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO4, CLO5</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">U</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slide trong bài</span><span class=\"v\">FLM không có</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>What this session covers (FLM, verbatim)</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nội dung buổi học (FLM, nguyên văn)</h3></div>\n<p>Activity - Event's Results Presentation<br>'- Summarize the event key results after finshied event master plan execution.<br>- The presentation should included: number of participants, ticket sales, results of marketing activities, goals/ objectives achivements, failures, lessons learned etc…<br>- The presentation should be visually appealing, captivating, and present data in a clear and precise manner.<br>- It should showcase the project's successes and setbacks, offering in-depth insights into the lessons learned.<br>- The presentation should include videos and photos from the event.</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Materials to read</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Tài liệu cần đọc</h3></div>\n<p>Textbook<br>Syllabus<br>Slide</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Student's tasks</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên</h3></div>\n<p>- Each group give 10 mins presentation<br>- Each group answer Q&amp;A by other groups</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">🧪 Practise in the <a href=\"/exam?course=EVN301\">Exam Room — EVN301</a> (4 practice papers: PE).</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">🧪 Luyện tại <a href=\"/exam?course=EVN301\">Phòng thi — EVN301</a> (4 đề luyện: PE).</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
